WEBVTT

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:03.450
Still retyping audit findings after a
walkthrough?

00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:06.930
And when someone asks for proof, where's
the evidence?

00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:11.530
With ICC Audits, you can record what you
find right from the checklist.

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:13.830
Say you're auditing final inspection.

00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:17.690
You spot a shipment that went out without
a final inspection sign-off.

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:21.170
Log the finding, then attach the shipment
release record.

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:25.170
Now your team can see what you found and
the evidence behind it.

00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:28.900
When you finish the audit, preview the
report with the finding already

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:32.960
included. You have one report to share,
and the evidence stays with the

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:37.460
audit. Book an Audits demo with ISO
Certification Consultants.
